{
  "lastModified": 1788170384410,
  "uri": "c::9511881484::vessel::b11b5ca0-a516-11f1-a348-4533e8d3f661",
  "yachtType": [
    "Sailing",
    "Catamaran"
  ],
  "description": "Operating Area: Caribbean All, Caribbean Leewards, Caribbean Virgin Islands (BVI), Caribbean Virgin Islands (US), Caribbean Virgin Islands (US/BVI), Caribbean Windwards\n\nWelcome aboard ATHENA, a beautifully appointed 2022 Lagoon 50 designed for unforgettable days at sea and relaxed island living. Combining generous outdoor spaces, contemporary interiors and the comfort of a large sailing catamaran, ATHENA is an exceptional choice for families and groups of friends looking to experience the Caribbean from the water.\n\nAccommodating up to 10 guests in five private cabins, each with its own ensuite bathroom, ATHENA offers an impressive level of privacy and comfort. Her bright, welcoming interior and thoughtfully prepared cabins provide peaceful retreats after a day of sailing, snorkeling and exploring ashore.\n\nLife aboard ATHENA is all about embracing the Caribbean. Wake to turquoise water outside your window, enjoy breakfast prepared especially for you, stretch out on the forward trampolines while sailing between islands, or gather together for sunset cocktails as another beautiful anchorage comes into view.\n\nATHENA is operated by a professional two-person crew – Captain and Chef – dedicated to creating a relaxed and personalized experience from the moment you step aboard. Her all-inclusive charters combine private sailing with freshly prepared meals, attentive service and an itinerary tailored around your group's interests and preferred pace.\n\nWith seasonal charter opportunities throughout the British Virgin Islands, U.S. Virgin Islands and the Grenadines, ATHENA opens the door to three extraordinary Caribbean cruising experiences. Discover the iconic beaches and lively island stops of the Virgin Islands, or venture south to the spectacular Grenadines, where secluded anchorages, brilliant blue water and charming island communities create a wonderfully authentic Caribbean escape.\n\nWhether celebrating something special, reconnecting with family and friends, or simply trading everyday life for a week barefoot at sea, ATHENA is your private home on the water – and the Caribbean is yours to explore.",
